    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it’s just so heavy. being a ghost isn't really peaceful, it's just... exhausting. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but there's nothing left to wait for. like the person who was supposed to experience life is just gone, and this version of me is just a shell that's taking up space. i'm just so tired of trying to find a reason to keep moving through the days when there's nothing actually there.",
